{"id":51119,"date":"2026-05-09T09:04:17","date_gmt":"2026-05-09T08:04:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/penafiel-run\/"},"modified":"2026-09-19T19:54:12","modified_gmt":"2026-09-19T18:54:12","slug":"penafiel-run","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/penafiel-run\/","title":{"rendered":"Penafiel Run 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Penafiel Run 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Penafiel Run 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>20 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida e chegada no <strong>Largo Conde Torres Novas (Campo da Feira)<\/strong>, em <strong>Penafiel<\/strong>, distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>. Organizada pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Penafiel<\/strong>, <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Penafiel<\/strong> e <strong>AMPLITUDESALUTAR \u2013 AD<\/strong> com cronometragem da <strong>SincTime<\/strong>, a prova assume uma nobre miss\u00e3o solid\u00e1ria, revertendo parte dos fundos a favor das tr\u00eas Corpora\u00e7\u00f5es de Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios do concelho.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partidas no cora\u00e7\u00e3o urbano da cidade, o programa arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> com a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> cronometrada e \u00e0s <strong>09:45<\/strong> com a <strong>Mini Corrida\/Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado percorre as art\u00e9rias centrais de Penafiel num ambiente de conv\u00edvio familiar, incluindo t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, medalha finisher para todos os participantes e seguro desportivo.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 de Setembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; backgrou